@startuml Updated_BPG_LLM_Architecture
!theme aws-orange
title BPG+LLM GUI Automation с RAG, MCP, Structured Outputs
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 8
  BorderColor #444
}

actor "Пользователь" as User

' === Input Processing Layer ===
package "INPUT PROCESSING LAYER" #F0F8FF {
  rectangle "Intent Capture\n• Natural language commands\n• Voice input processing\n• Context-aware parsing" as UserIntentCapture
  rectangle "Visual Context Capture\n• Screenshot acquisition\n• Multimodal analysis (GPT-4V)\n• Element identification" as VisualCapture
  rectangle "Current State Analysis\n• Page identification\n• User session context\n• Navigation history" as StateAnalysis
}

' === RAG-Enhanced Knowledge Base ===
package "RAG-ENHANCED KNOWLEDGE BASE" #E8F5E8 {
  rectangle "Vector Knowledge Store" #LightGreen {
    rectangle "BPG Pattern Embeddings\n• Business process vectors\n• Entity relationship vectors\n• Navigation pattern vectors" as BPGVectors
    rectangle "Semantic Search Engine\n• FAISS/Pinecone integration\n• Similarity-based retrieval\n• Relevance ranking" as SemanticSearch
    rectangle "Context Retrieval Engine\n• Multi-hop knowledge retrieval\n• Cross-entity linking\n• Pattern matching" as ContextRetrieval
  }

  rectangle "Structured Knowledge Store" #LightYellow {
    rectangle "Neo4j Graph Database\n• Business entity relationships\n• Process dependencies\n• Cross-view entity mappings" as Neo4jStore
    rectangle "Pattern Templates\n• Parameterized workflows\n• Structured execution plans\n• Success criteria" as PatternTemplates
    rectangle "Business Rules\n• Validation constraints\n• Conditional logic\n• Exception handling" as BusinessRules
  }
}

' === MCP Integration Layer ===
package "MCP INTEGRATION LAYER" #FFE4B5 {
  rectangle "MCP Server Registry\n• Knowledge source connectors\n• External system adapters\n• Plugin management" as MCPRegistry
  rectangle "Knowledge Access Layer\n• Standardized data retrieval\n• Multi-source aggregation\n• Real-time updates" as KnowledgeAccess
  rectangle "Context Enrichment\n• Dynamic knowledge injection\n• Multi-source fusion\n• Conflict resolution" as ContextEnrichment
}

' === LLM Orchestration with Modern Features ===
package "LLM ORCHESTRATION LAYER" #FFF8E1 {
  rectangle "Prompt Engineering Engine" #LightCoral {
    rectangle "RAG Context Assembly\n• Knowledge retrieval integration\n• Context compression\n• Token optimization" as RAGAssembly
    rectangle "Prompt Cache Manager\n• OpenAI/Anthropic caching\n• Response memoization\n• Cache invalidation" as PromptCache
    rectangle "Dynamic Prompt Builder\n• Template-based construction\n• Multi-modal prompt fusion\n• Context injection" as PromptBuilder
  }

  rectangle "Multi-LLM Coordination" #Lavender {
    rectangle "Smart Model Router\n• Complexity-based routing\n• Cost optimization\n• Fallback strategies" as ModelRouter
    rectangle "Multimodal Reasoning\n• GPT-4V visual analysis\n• Cross-modal synthesis\n• Evidence integration" as MultimodalReasoning
    rectangle "Structured Output Generator\n• Pydantic schema validation\n• JSON schema enforcement\n• Type safety guarantees" as StructuredOutput
  }

  rectangle "Function Calling Interface" #LightCyan {
    rectangle "Tool Registry\n• BPG query functions\n• Validation functions\n• Execution functions" as ToolRegistry
    rectangle "Function Orchestrator\n• Tool selection logic\n• Parameter validation\n• Result integration" as FunctionOrchestrator
    rectangle "Business Logic Validator\n• Rule checking functions\n• Constraint validation\n• State verification" as BusinessValidator
  }
}

' === Execution Layer ===
package "EXECUTION LAYER" #F5F0FF {
  rectangle "Platform Abstraction\n• Web (Playwright)\n• Desktop (OS APIs)\n• Mobile (Appium)" as PlatformAbstraction
  rectangle "Template Executor\n• Pattern instantiation\n• Parameter substitution\n• Action sequencing" as TemplateExecutor
  rectangle "Real-time Adaptation\n• UI change detection\n• Dynamic re-planning\n• Error recovery" as RealtimeAdaptation
}

' === Data Flow with Modern Technologies ===
User --> UserIntentCapture : "Add product to cart"
UserIntentCapture --> VisualCapture : intent + context
VisualCapture --> MultimodalReasoning : screenshot + text

' RAG Flow
MultimodalReasoning --> SemanticSearch : multimodal query
SemanticSearch --> BPGVectors : vector similarity
BPGVectors --> ContextRetrieval : relevant patterns
ContextRetrieval --> Neo4jStore : graph traversal

' MCP Integration
ContextRetrieval --> MCPRegistry : external knowledge request
MCPRegistry --> KnowledgeAccess : standardized query
KnowledgeAccess --> ContextEnrichment : multi-source data

' Prompt Engineering with Caching
ContextEnrichment --> PromptCache : cache check
PromptCache --> RAGAssembly : cache miss/assembly
RAGAssembly --> PromptBuilder : enriched context

' LLM Processing
PromptBuilder --> ModelRouter : optimized prompt
ModelRouter --> StructuredOutput : model selection
StructuredOutput --> FunctionOrchestrator : structured plan

' Function Calling
FunctionOrchestrator --> ToolRegistry : function selection
ToolRegistry --> BusinessValidator : validation calls
BusinessValidator --> TemplateExecutor : validated actions

' Execution
TemplateExecutor --> PlatformAbstraction : execution commands
PlatformAbstraction --> RealtimeAdaptation : platform actions
RealtimeAdaptation --> User : automated results

' === Technology Integration Notes ===
note right of MultimodalReasoning
**Multimodal Reasoning Implementation:**
• GPT-4V for visual understanding
• Cross-modal evidence synthesis
• Visual + textual + spatial analysis
• Confidence scoring across modalities

**Used specifically for:**
• Cross-view entity linking
• Complex UI understanding
• Ambiguous visual contexts
end note

note right of StructuredOutput
**Structured Outputs with Pydantic:**
```python
class GUIAction(BaseModel):
    action_type: str
    target_element: str
    parameters: Dict[str, Any]
    confidence: float
    business_reasoning: str

class ExecutionPlan(BaseModel):
    steps: List[GUIAction]
    fallback_strategy: Optional[str]
    validation_rules: List[str]
```
**Benefits:** 100% parseability, type safety
end note

note right of PromptCache
**Prompt Caching Strategy:**
• OpenAI/Anthropic native caching
• Redis fallback for complex contexts
• 60-80% cost reduction on repeated patterns
• Smart cache invalidation based on context changes

**Cache Keys:**
• BPG pattern signatures
• Context fingerprints
• User session identifiers
end note

note right of ToolRegistry
**Function Calling Tools:**
```python
@tool
def validate_business_rule(entity_id: str, action: str):
    """Validate action against business rules"""
    return bpg.check_constraints(entity_id, action)

@tool
def get_similar_patterns(current_context: Dict):
    """Retrieve similar execution patterns"""
    return vector_search.find_similar(current_context)

@tool
def execute_template(template_id: str, params: Dict):
    """Execute parameterized template"""
    return template_engine.execute(template_id, params)
```
end note

note bottom
**Key Technology Integration:**

**RAG for BPG:** Semantic retrieval of business patterns, 40-60% accuracy improvement
**MCP Protocol:** Standardized knowledge access, plugin architecture for external systems
**Multimodal Reasoning:** Visual+text synthesis for cross-view entity linking
**Structured Outputs:** Pydantic schemas for 100% parseability and type safety
**Function Calling:** Tool-based architecture for deterministic business logic
**Prompt Caching:** 60-80% cost reduction through intelligent response caching

**NO Fine-tuning:** Relies on in-context learning and retrieval augmentation
end note

@enduml